This example includes a curated excerpt derived from:

  3D Printing Concrete Mix Design Open Dataset (v0.3)
  Jianhao Gao, Zijie Wang, Chaofeng Wang (University of Florida)
  Zenodo — https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.6828947

